# Outfit camera (R18): a cine camera: boxy body, a long steel lens barrel ending in an open matte box, two accent film
# reels standing on top (the magazine), a steel top handle and a glowing tally light.
name outfit_cinecam
grid 5
size 11 5 9
slot body Ink
slot lens Steel
slot reel SwatchAccent
slot tally SwatchGlow
box 0 0 0 6 5 4 body
beam 6 2.5 2 9 2.5 2 1.2 lens
box 9 0 0 11 5 4 body
carve box 9 1 1 11 4 3
ellipsoid 1.6 2.5 6.4 1.6 1 1.7 reel
ellipsoid 4.6 2.5 6.4 1.6 1 1.7 reel
box 1 2 4 6 3 5 lens
box 2 2 5 5 3 6 lens
box 5 0 3 6 1 4 tally
pivot 3 2 0
